Added `frontend/packages/identity-core`, a package shared by the frontends, with a lint rule that rejects any import of Volto, Aurora, Redux, a router or an i18n library in it, and `frontend/aurora`, a development harness running Plone Aurora 1.0.0-alpha.16 with `frontend/packages/aurora-identity`, generated from Cookieplone's `aurora_addon` template. `make aurora-install`, `make aurora-start`, `make aurora-build`, `make aurora-lint` and `make aurora-test` drive it, and a new CI job lints, typechecks, tests and builds it and checks its catalogues. Core's messages are extracted, translated and checked by `make i18n` and `make ci-i18n` alongside the Volto add-on's. @sneridagh
